  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "dsh-model-search",
      "text": "Searchable model picker + provider management for the DeepSeek Harness (DSH) web UI."
    },
    {
      "section": "Features",
      "text": "- **Composer seat**: filter-as-you-type popover (model + reasoning effort)\n- **Settings page**: browse providers, search their model catalogs live, add API keys, manage provider config"
    },
    {
      "section": "Architecture",
      "text": "```\nlib/\n├── index.js          # host entry (tools only — no webServer, runs in any profile)\n├── host/\n│   └── web.mjs       # web-only half (API routes for the settings page)\n\nHost tools half registers `model_search_*` tools. Host web half registers `/dsh-model-search/*` routes.\nClient half registers the composer seat slot and a `settings.providers` tab."
    },
    {
      "section": "Install",
      "text": "```sh\ncd ~/.dsh/profiles/web\npnpm add github:johndfowler/dsh-model-search"
    },
    {
      "section": "then add to dsh.profile.bundles and restart `dsh web`.",
      "text": "```"
    },
    {
      "section": "License",
      "text": "MIT"
    }
